mujoco4-speculative-contacts — NOTICE

This directory (apps/mujoco4-speculative-contacts/) is a CPU-only clear
experiment on speculative contacts in MuJoCo 4.0.0. The MuJoCo physics
engine is used as a PyPI dependency. Its source is not vendored.

